#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1039 expect=skipped domain=TI
#note "TRIAL DESIGN is not in Classes.Include [EVENTS, INTERVENTIONS, FINDINGS, FINDINGS ABOUT] -> class gate rejects (the [--CAT] gate would too: TI's category variable is IECAT, and --CAT resolves TICAT). Pins the r2 W11 ruling that the sheet's trailing 'TI' token is not coverable by the -- wildcard and stays uncovered."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TI class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Inclusion/Exclusion Criteria"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col IETESTCD type=Char
col IETEST   type=Char
col IECAT    type=Char
---
S1 | TI | INCL01 | Age >= 18 | INCLUSION
---
